#: org.kde.kbruch.appdata.xml:6
#, fuzzy
msgid "KBruch"
msgstr "KBruch"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.kbruch.appdata.xml:7
#, fuzzy
msgid "Exercise Fractions"
msgstr "Exercicios de fraiciones"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kbruch.appdata.xml:9
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"KBruch is a small program to practice calculating with fractions and "
"percentages. Different exercises are provided for this purpose and you can "
"use the learning mode to practice with fractions. The program checks the "
"user's input and gives feedback."
msgstr ""
"KBruch ye un programa pequeñu pa prauticar el cálculu con fraiciones y "
"porcentaxes. Apúrrense diferentes exercicios pa esti propósitu y pues usar "
"el mou deprendimientu pa prauticar con fraiciones. El programa comprueba "
"la entrada del usuariu y da encamientos."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kbruch.appdata.xml:10
#, fuzzy
msgid "Features:"
msgstr "Carauterístiques:"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kbruch.appdata.xml:12
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Arithmetic exercise - in this exercise you have to solve a given fraction "
"task. You have to enter the numerator and the denominator. This is the main "
"exercise."
msgstr ""
"Exerciciu aritméticu - nesti exerciciu tienes de resolver una xera de "
"fraiciones "
"daes. Tienes d'introducir el numberador y el denominador. Esti ye l'exercicu "
"principal."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kbruch.appdata.xml:13
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Comparison exercise - in this exercise you have to compare the size of 2 "
"given fractions, using the symbols &gt;, &lt; or =."
msgstr ""
"Exerciciu de comparanza - Nesti exerciciu tienes de comparar el tamañu "
"de 2 fraiciones daes, usando los símbolos &gt;, &lt; ó =."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kbruch.appdata.xml:14
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Conversion exercise - in this exercise you have to convert a given number "
"into a fraction."
msgstr ""
"Exerciciu de conversión - nesti exerciciu tienes de convertir un númberu dau "
"a una fraición."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kbruch.appdata.xml:15
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Factorization exercise - in this exercise you have to factorize a given "
"number into its prime factors."
msgstr ""
"Exerciciu de fautorización - nesti exerciciu tienes de fautorizar un "
"númberu dau a los sos fautores primos."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kbruch.appdata.xml:16
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Percentage exercise - in this exercise you have to calculate percentages."
msgstr ""
"Exerciciu de porcentaxe - nesti exerciciu tienes de calcular porcentaxes."

